# ==============================================================================
# Rohan Patil Portfolio — Environment Variables Configuration
# ==============================================================================
#
# Vite exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to client-side code.
# NEVER store private secrets, database connection strings, or secret API keys here.
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contact Form Endpoint (Optional)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If left empty or omitted, the contact section automatically operates in
# "Direct Mail Client" fallback mode, transparently launching the user's mail
# application pre-addressed to itzrohan7744@gmail.com without pretending to send.
#
# To enable background API form submissions, set one of the following providers:
#
# Option A: Formspree (Free tier available)
# 1. Sign up at https://formspree.io
# 2. Create a new form pointing to itzrohan7744@gmail.com
# 3. Copy your Form ID (e.g., 'mwpkznoy') and paste the full endpoint URL below:
# VITE_CONTACT_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your_form_id
#
# Option B: Web3Forms (No-server form provider)
# 1. Get an access key at https://web3forms.com
# 2. Use: VITE_CONTACT_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://api.web3forms.com/submit
# (Web3Forms requires an access_key field in the payload)
#
# Option C: Custom Backend / Serverless Function
# VITE_CONTACT_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://your-api.vercel.app/api/contact
#
VITE_CONTACT_FORM_ENDPOINT=
